### P1-1: God Class Refactoring ✅ 80% COMPLETE (4/5 Components)

**Problem**: AgentConfigDialog (1,256 lines, 9 responsibilities) violates Single Responsibility Principle

**Solution**: Systematic extraction into focused components following December 2025 patterns

**Components Extracted**:

1. **ApiKeyInputSection** (185 lines)
   - Location: `/src/presentation/components/agent/ApiKeyInputSection.tsx`
