   - Reusable: Can be used in any agent configuration context

3. **AgentImportExport** (175 lines)
   - Location: `/src/presentation/components/agent/AgentImportExport.tsx`
   - Features: JSON export/import, merge strategies, hidden file input
   - Integration: Uses existing agent-io utilities

4. **AgentBasicConfig** (323 lines)
   - Location: `/src/presentation/components/agent/AgentBasicConfig.tsx`
   - Features: Name, description, provider selection, model selection with refresh
   - Provider Store Integration: Uses useProviderStore for models/providers

**Barrel Export Created**:
- Location: `/src/presentation/components/agent/index.ts`
- Purpose: Centralized exports for all agent components
- Follows December 2025 barrel export pattern

