## December 2025 Patterns Applied

### Component Architecture
- ✅ **Single Responsibility Principle**: Each component has one clear purpose
- ✅ **Component Size Limit**: New components under 120 lines (docs excluded)
- ✅ **Max Functions Per Module**: 3 functions maximum to prevent god classes
- ✅ **Composition Over Inheritance**: Breaking complex UI into composable parts

### Type Safety
- ✅ **TypeScript Interfaces**: Proper typing for all component props
- ✅ **Zod Schema Validation**: Declarative validation with type inference
- ✅ **Domain Types**: Using centralized types from `/core/entities` and `/domain`

### Accessibility Standards
- ✅ **ARIA Labels**: All interactive elements properly labeled
- ✅ **Keyboard Navigation**: Full keyboard support with proper focus management
- ✅ **Screen Reader Support**: Semantic HTML with ARIA roles
- ✅ **Error Announcements**: Errors announced to screen readers
- ✅ **Focus Traps**: Modals trap focus for accessibility

### State Management
- ✅ **Single Source of Truth**: Zustand stores for each domain
- ✅ **Hot-Reload Support**: Immediate UI updates on configuration changes
- ✅ **Cross-Workspace Events**: Event-driven updates via cross-workspace-event-bus
- ✅ **Persistence Strategy**: Dexie IndexedDB with proper hydration

