## Technical Debt Addressed

### Before (P0 Issues)
- ❌ No unsaved changes warnings → Data loss risk
- ❌ Provider deletion orphaned agents → Data corruption
- ❌ No error boundary → Complete page crash risk
- ❌ 1,256-line god class → Unmaintainable code

### After (Current State)
- ✅ Unsaved changes warning infrastructure (reusable)
- ✅ Provider deletion validates dependencies → Data integrity protected
- ✅ Error boundary with graceful fallback → Resilient UI
